<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/T(We conducted a scoping review to map the landscape of global and national pandemic preparedness assessment and risk frameworks, synthesizing existing tools\220 uses, influences, and limitations.  First, we identified relevant preparedness and risk-assessment frameworks through desktop searching of academic databases, government sources, and grey literature. Search  terms included \215pandemic,\216  \215epidemic,\216 \215preparedness,\216 \215risk  assessment,\216 \215model,\216 and  \215framework,\216 combined with Boolean  operators. We included tools that:)/E(We conducted a scoping review to map the landscape of global and national pandemic preparedness assessment and risk frameworks, synthesizing existing tools\220 uses, influences, and limitations.  First, we identified relevant preparedness and risk-assessment frameworks through desktop searching of academic databases, government sources, and grey literature. Search  terms included \215pandemic,\216  \215epidemic,\216 \215preparedness,\216 \215risk  assessment,\216 \215model,\216 and  \215framework,\216 combined with Boolean  operators. We included tools that:)/Pg 17 0 R/K[0 1]>>
