<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(To inform our review of existing tools and recommendations for the components and design of a future PRA tool, our team conducted an anonymized structured consultation process with global health experts across governance, academia, and the nonprofit and private sectors. We approached 76 individuals representing 64 organizations and research institutions engaged in pandemic preparedness, risk modeling, surveillance, financing, and emergency management. We ultimately conducted 27 consultations. The consultants interviewed were kept anonymous to encourage greater transparency on the topics discussed.)/E(To inform our review of existing tools and recommendations for the components and design of a future PRA tool, our team conducted an anonymized structured consultation process with global health experts across governance, academia, and the nonprofit and private sectors. We approached 76 individuals representing 64 organizations and research institutions engaged in pandemic preparedness, risk modeling, surveillance, financing, and emergency management. We ultimately conducted 27 consultations. The consultants interviewed were kept anonymous to encourage greater transparency on the topics discussed.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[29 30 31]>>
endobj

