531 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(INFLUENZA RISK ASSESSMENT TOOL \(IRAT\)\204CDC)/E(INFLUENZA RISK ASSESSMENT TOOL \(IRAT\)\204CDC)/Pg 22 0 R/K[3]>>
