<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(distribution and emergence and impact likelihoods across rural vs. urban settings, among other factors. Furthermore, this assessment tool is limited to influenza A viruses alone. While the IRAT promises to incorporate emerging risk elements to better understand influenza A virus emergence, this limited analysis provides a narrow scope through which to assess pandemic potential of such strains.12, 13)/E(distribution and emergence and impact likelihoods across rural vs. urban settings, among other factors. Furthermore, this assessment tool is limited to influenza A viruses alone. While the IRAT promises to incorporate emerging risk elements to better understand influenza A virus emergence, this limited analysis provides a narrow scope through which to assess pandemic potential of such strains.12, 13)/Pg 23 0 R/K[2 3]>>
