<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(In 2019, a collaboration between the Nuclear Threat Initiative \(NTI\), the Johns Hopkins Center for Health Security at the Bloomberg School of Public Health, and Economist Impact brought about the Global Health Security \(GHS\) Index. The third and most recent edition of the GHS Index is being developed in partnership with Brown )/E(In 2019, a collaboration between the Nuclear Threat Initiative \(NTI\), the Johns Hopkins Center for Health Security at the Bloomberg School of Public Health, and Economist Impact brought about the Global Health Security \(GHS\) Index. The third and most recent edition of the GHS Index is being developed in partnership with Brown )/Pg 26 0 R/K[2 3]>>
endobj

