727 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1453 0 R/E(Economic Impacts: Existing tools do not assess how regional economic factors, such as dependence on a single sector or a strong agricultural focus, impact pandemic risk, nor the economic cost associated with pandemics.)/Pg 42 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

