785 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/T(Fiscal policymakers, health officials, financers, and researchers tend to have drastically different needs for PRA tools, as outlined previously. The most effective tools are designed such that they can provide value to multiple stakeholders, either through generalizable engagement principles or user-oriented output structures. As such, developers should be transparent with which tool is best suited for each type of end user.)/E(Fiscal policymakers, health officials, financers, and researchers tend to have drastically different needs for PRA tools, as outlined previously. The most effective tools are designed such that they can provide value to multiple stakeholders, either through generalizable engagement principles or user-oriented output structures. As such, developers should be transparent with which tool is best suited for each type of end user.)/Pg 47 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

