795 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/T(One key area of improvement for PRA tools is in creating outputs that resonate with and inform its numerous end-users, creating the necessary conditions for political, health system, and financial change in a country. As discussed earlier, current tools\220 outputs suffer from a number of engagement issues across end-users. While ideally the final output of each tool would differ based on the individual needs of each end-user, there emerged several broad strategies that could improve stakeholder engagement across the board:)/E(One key area of improvement for PRA tools is in creating outputs that resonate with and inform its numerous end-users, creating the necessary conditions for political, health system, and financial change in a country. As discussed earlier, current tools\220 outputs suffer from a number of engagement issues across end-users. While ideally the final output of each tool would differ based on the individual needs of each end-user, there emerged several broad strategies that could improve stakeholder engagement across the board:)/Pg 48 0 R/K[0 1]>>
endobj

796 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 1462 0 R/T(   Concision and Accessibility: First, for most end-users, reports should be designed with a specific audience in mind to help increase the accessibility and usability of these tools for busy policymakers and funders. )/E(   Concision and Accessibility: First, for most end-users, reports should be designed with a specific audience in mind to help increase the accessibility and usability of these tools for busy policymakers and funders. )/Pg 48 0 R/K[7 8]>>
endobj

797 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 1463 0 R/T(  Context-Aware Recommendations: Second, ensuring reports are context-aware, in terms of the political, financial, and local landscape, could help refine recommendations into proposals that end-users can feasibly translate into impact. )/E(  Context-Aware Recommendations: Second, ensuring reports are context-aware, in terms of the political, financial, and local landscape, could help refine recommendations into proposals that end-users can feasibly translate into impact. )/Pg 48 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

798 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 1464 0 R/T(  Delivering Impact-Focused and Quantified Feedback: Finally, basing potential actionable recommendations on the quantifiable impact of these changes could help engage the more pragmatic and economically-minded stakeholders, like finance ministers and philanthropists, who benefit from clear estimates from costs, benefits, and return on investment.)/E(  Delivering Impact-Focused and Quantified Feedback: Finally, basing potential actionable recommendations on the quantifiable impact of these changes could help engage the more pragmatic and economically-minded stakeholders, like finance ministers and philanthropists, who benefit from clear estimates from costs, benefits, and return on investment.)/Pg 48 0 R/K[10]>>
