851 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/T(In keeping with the design principles framework proposed in Figure 2, we have structured our recommendations to target the foundational elements of a PRA tool, the architectural and operational design of such a tool, and output of a PRA tool.)/E(In keeping with the design principles framework proposed in Figure 2, we have structured our recommendations to target the foundational elements of a PRA tool, the architectural and operational design of such a tool, and output of a PRA tool.)/Pg 57 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

852 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(Foundational  Level Recommendations )/E(Foundational  Level Recommendations )/Pg 57 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

